🚀 Plan Files Help You Manage Development With AI 🤖

Getting Started:

- "check plans" 👀
  Copilot has all the context necessary to understand plan files when it starts. Just ask it what the current status is!

- "let's make a plan" 📝
  (followed by a description of what you would like to do)
  This tells Copilot to follow the instructions for creating a plan. The TEMPLATE.md will guide Copilot to come up with a specific plan with clear success criteria, steps, etc.

- "Let's implement plan <the-plan>" 🛠️
  Get to work!

- "Create a stop point" ⏸️
  This directs Copilot to document all its work and write next steps to the plan file. You are then free to `/clear context` or exit.

- "Continue plan <in-progress-plan>" 🔄
  Does what it says.

- "This plan is complete" ✅
  Sets Copilot in motion to complete the plan.

The AI understands natural language but these phrases will always work.

